    },
    {
        "text": "(Panting)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get down, old man!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not you! The beast!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, get down! I'm setting off my Originium Arts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 0.93,
        "g": 0.7,
        "b": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.93,
        "g": 0.75,
        "b": 0.32,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grab my hand. Are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that? Those beasts went down in the blink of an eye...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium Arts using this Arts Unit. My own special trick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... parlor tricks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The traps will slow the rest. Leave them to Sumoto's group. We can head over to the other side, where the defenses are thinner... Take it easy, old man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the crap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's with that look on your face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, just thinking back to the days when us hunters fought side by side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been seven years, and this is the first time you haven't told me to get lost or called me a traitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I didn't think you would really take up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Akira's hunting spear. You can say it. I know you were Akira's mentor. You didn't think I would go kill those beasts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You weren't a hunter at the time, and you objected to Akira becoming one. His sacrifice changed you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad you noticed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old man, there's something... Perhaps you've misunderstood all this time, and I wasn't sure how to tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't abandon him to die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lure powder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You knew?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm his father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That idiot sacrificed himself to protect your mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember the look on his face that day, his eyes, his every move...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cries of the beasts were everywhere. He opened his mouth to say something, but it was drowned out by the noise. I remember his pale lips...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could he have been saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
