        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato! Here comes the Rathalos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_750_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After our previous encounters, it now sees all humans as a threat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Palico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It landed near the Kashiwau house, and it's getting closer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reinforcements are still pretty far off. Not all the villagers have made it to the shelter either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the worst possible timing... You oversee the evacuation. I'll\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over there, Yato! Beasts! I see five of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The stampede is coming. The hunters' defenses can't stop all of them. We must protect the evacuating villagers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do then? Just sit here and wait for the Rathalos? That will only make things worse!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinking... We need a way to stop the Rathalos for a while, at least until all the villagers are safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kashiwau...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kashiwau? But we don't even know where he is. And he's just one man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see him, near the hut.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's close to the Rathalos! Yato, maybe we should\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have time to complete the evacuation if he can delay it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean... we're not helping him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just have to trust him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
