    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Opens a can of oil)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think so too, eh? Today's a good day. The heavens burn red.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So many things have happened lately. A little girl came back all grown up, stirring up all kinds of trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "text": "A firebreathing monster appeared out of nowhere, and two outsiders went in trouble near the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then beasts came rushing up, their mine blew up, a Catastrophe struck, and they couldn't even run away properly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the funniest part? People keep coming to dig up my past from the mud and rub my face in it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all say it's for my sake, but each shard of it they dig up cuts me open, piece by piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noir Corne had the right idea. The truth isn't important. Let the past stay in the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let the dead stay dead. Burn it all, leave nothing behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
