    },
    {
        "text": "He hears the sobbing of flames, swallowing up the fragments of the past."
    },
    {
        "text": "The ashes of time drift before his eyes, burning away the gaze of regret."
    },
    {
        "text": "Burn."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This fire is so beautiful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd have done the same, wouldn't you, Akira?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take the next step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
