    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even the corners of your jaws are singed. Your scales are full of scars. You big ugly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that? Sparks from your mouth? Are you angry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look away. Your enemy's right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at me. Yes. That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be angry. Be angrier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
